    "ja": "999999回死んだ俺　～不死身スキルで無限レベルアップ～"
   },
   {
    "en": "I Died 999999 Times – Infinite Level Up with Invulnerability Skills"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "White Lotus, the world’s strongest hunter guild, is praised as a group of heroes for defeating the Demon Lords.  \n\nBut their power comes from something far darker—ruthless and inhumane cruelty. They captured Makoto and Minori, a pair of immortal siblings, and slaughtered them repeatedly to farm experience points.  \n\nDesperate to survive and fueled by vengeance, the siblings make a brutal choice: killing each other to level up.\n\n\"Let’s begin our revenge.\" \n\nThrough relentless battles and newfound powers, they carve a path of blood and retribution."
  },
